I have my ticket now.
I am standing on the platform.
But I cannot get in yet.
I must stamp the ticket first.
Without a stamp the ticket is not valid.
I see a small box.
It is hanging on a pillar.
The box is bright yellow.
I walk over to the pillar.
I put the ticket into the slot.
I hear a loud click.
The machine prints the time on the ticket.
I pull it back out.
Now my ticket is valid.
I put it safely into my jacket pocket.
Today I am travelling far with the U-Bahn.
Later I must then change to the S-Bahn.
I look at the tracks.
My train is coming in two minutes.
